      "uid": "zhcn:2bd7ffdef3557bc4db9e6bf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！那孩子，嗖地一下跑过去，\n转眼间就冲过终点了！？",
