      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，没错。在这场赛事中——\n在那孩子的奔跑中，历史被改写了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f848ad930f5d19b061e407a18516283cecb58d560db16bc9ad0e62fe2e9edb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
