      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好厉害好厉害！\n那位大姐姐，从后面猛冲上来——\n超过最前面的孩子了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6b192bb70b2ba2fd25e3695808332f6728d899413aee302475145e589414ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0289/storytimeline_830289002.json",
      "json_path": [
